{"seq":3,"slug":"loot-model","title":"掉落模型：掉落表的数据结构与嵌套组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/foundations/loot-model","wordCount":1422,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"掉落模型-掉落表的数据结构与嵌套组合\">掉落模型：掉落表的数据结构与嵌套组合</h1><p>同样是「掉落一件蓝装」，《暗黑破坏神 II》要经过 <code>TreasureClass → 品质判定 → 具体物品 → 词缀生成</code> 四层表的接力，而一个简单手游可能只是一个 <code>[{item, weight}]</code> 数组。这一篇要建立的，是一套能同时表达这两种极端的<strong>掉落数据模型</strong>——它是<a href=\"../sampling/\">抽取</a>章所有算法的输入，也是策划每天在配置里打交道的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-掉落表的最小结构\">核心概念：掉落表的最小结构</h2><p>剥到最简，一张掉落表就是一组带权重的条目。每个条目有三样东西：产出是什么、权重多大、可选的数量范围。用 JSON 表达一张最基础的表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;goblin_common&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rolls&quot;: 1,&#10;  &quot;entries&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;item&quot;: &quot;gold&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 60, &quot;min&quot;: 5, &quot;max&quot;: 20 },&#10;    { &quot;item&quot;: &quot;health_potion&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 30, &quot;min&quot;: 1, &quot;max&quot;: 1 },&#10;    { &quot;item&quot;: &quot;iron_sword&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 9, &quot;min&quot;: 1, &quot;max&quot;: 1 },&#10;    { &quot;item&quot;: &quot;rare_gem&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 1, &quot;min&quot;: 1, &quot;max&quot;: 1 }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"goblin_common\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rolls\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"health_potion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iron_sword\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rare_gem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里的 <code>weight</code> 不是概率——概率要归一化后才得到。某条目 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的掉落概率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = w_i / \\sum_j w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。上例总权重 100，<code>rare_gem</code> 的掉率就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/100 = 1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span>。用权重而非概率是刻意的：策划想新增一个物品时，只需加一行不用重算其它所有概率，这是配置友好性的关键。<code>rolls</code> 表示这张表抽几次，决定单次结算掉几件。</p>\n<p>下面这张流程图展示一次掉落如何从上下文一路走到最终物品列表：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[掉落请求&lt;br/&gt;上下文:怪ID·难度·玩家] --&gt; B[解析掉落表引用]&#10;  B --&gt; C[应用条件过滤&lt;br/&gt;去掉不满足条件的条目]&#10;  C --&gt; D[归一化剩余权重]&#10;  D --&gt; E[执行 rolls 次抽样]&#10;  E --&gt; F{条目是子表引用?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[递归展开子表]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[加入结果·roll 数量范围]&#10;  G --&gt; E&#10;  H --&gt; I[返回掉落物品列表]\">flowchart TD\n  A[掉落请求&lt;br/&gt;上下文:怪ID·难度·玩家] --&gt; B[解析掉落表引用]\n  B --&gt; C[应用条件过滤&lt;br/&gt;去掉不满足条件的条目]\n  C --&gt; D[归一化剩余权重]\n  D --&gt; E[执行 rolls 次抽样]\n  E --&gt; F{条目是子表引用?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[递归展开子表]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[加入结果·roll 数量范围]\n  G --&gt; E\n  H --&gt; I[返回掉落物品列表]</pre><h2 id=\"嵌套表-用组合对抗复杂度\">嵌套表：用组合对抗复杂度</h2><p>真实游戏的掉落逻辑无法塞进一张扁平表，解法是<strong>嵌套</strong>——条目的产出可以不是物品，而是「引用另一张掉落表」。这让掉落表变成一棵可复用的树：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;boss_dragon&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rolls&quot;: 3,&#10;  &quot;entries&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;table&quot;: &quot;tier_common&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 70 },&#10;    { &quot;table&quot;: &quot;tier_rare&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 25 },&#10;    { &quot;table&quot;: &quot;tier_legendary&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 5 }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"boss_dragon\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rolls\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"table\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier_common\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"table\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier_rare\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"table\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier_legendary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>boss_dragon</code> 不直接列物品，而是先按 70/25/5 抽一个稀有度子表，再进那张子表抽具体物品。这正是<a href=\"../sampling/rarity-tiers\">稀有度层级</a>那篇要深讲的两阶段抽样结构。嵌套的价值在复用：<code>tier_rare</code> 可以被上百种怪共享，改一次全局生效。嵌套也带来风险——递归引用可能成环（表 A 引用 B、B 又引用 A），加载时必须做环检测，否则抽样会栈溢出。</p>\n<p>下表列出掉落条目常见的几种「产出类型」，一个成熟的模型应全部支持：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产出类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物品</td>\n<td>直接产出具体物品</td>\n<td><code>iron_sword</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子表引用</td>\n<td>递归进入另一张表</td>\n<td><code>table: tier_rare</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空(nothing)</td>\n<td>什么都不掉</td>\n<td>权重占位，降低总掉率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货币/资源</td>\n<td>数量型产出</td>\n<td><code>gold</code> min-max</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>掉落组(group)</td>\n<td>一次性掉一整组</td>\n<td>套装碎片</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「空条目」是个常被忽略却极有用的技巧：想让一只怪 40% 概率什么都不掉，就加一个 <code>weight</code> 合适的 <code>nothing</code> 条目，而不是去改所有其它条目的概率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条件与上下文掉落\">条件与上下文掉落</h2><p>静态掉落表只能表达「这只怪固定掉这些」，但现代游戏要的是<strong>上下文敏感</strong>的掉落：新手保护（低等级玩家提高掉率）、首杀奖励、限时活动物品、防重复（已拥有的不再掉）。这靠给条目附加<strong>条件</strong>（condition）实现，抽样前先过滤掉不满足条件的条目再归一化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;item&quot;: &quot;beginner_shield&quot;,&#10;  &quot;weight&quot;: 20,&#10;  &quot;conditions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;player_level&quot;, &quot;max&quot;: 10 },&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;not_owned&quot;, &quot;item&quot;: &quot;beginner_shield&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"beginner_shield\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"player_level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"not_owned\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"beginner_shield\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个盾只对 10 级以下、且尚未拥有它的玩家出现在候选集里。条件过滤发生在归一化<strong>之前</strong>这一点至关重要：过滤后剩余条目的权重要重新归一化，否则被过滤掉的权重会「凭空蒸发」导致总掉率意外下降。<code>not_owned</code> 这类去重条件是坏运保护的一种朴素形式，更系统的做法见<a href=\"../fairness/bad-luck-protection\">坏运保护</a>。</p>\n<p>条件系统也是「智能掉落」（smart loot，如《暗黑破坏神 III》按角色职业偏向掉对应装备）的基础：把「玩家当前职业」作为上下文，给匹配职业的物品更高权重。这类设计的经济后果——它如何影响物品的稀缺与流通——要放到<a href=\"../practice/loot-economy\">掉落与经济平衡</a>里评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据格式与热更\">数据格式与热更</h2><p>掉落表作为纯数据，格式选择直接影响迭代效率。业界主流有三种：CSV/表格（策划最熟，适合扁平表，难表达嵌套）、JSON/YAML（能表达嵌套与条件，可读性好，是多数现代引擎的选择）、以及专用二进制（打包后体积小、加载快，但不可读，通常从前两者编译而来）。</p>\n<p>关键工程实践是<strong>热更</strong>：掉落表应能在不重启游戏/不重发版的情况下更新。运营在活动期间临时调低某掉率、或紧急修复一个错配的掉落，都依赖热更能力。热更的具体实现（版本校验、原子替换、回滚）属于<a href=\"../practice/loot-tables-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>的范畴，这里只强调：把掉落建模成外部数据而非硬编码，热更才成为可能——这也呼应了<a href=\"why-loot-tables\">为何掉落表</a>一开始讲的数据驱动价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>掉落表的最小结构是一组带权重条目；权重经归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = w_i/\\sum_j w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才得到概率，用权重是为了配置友好。</li>\n<li>嵌套（条目引用子表）用组合对抗复杂度、实现复用，但要做环检测防栈溢出。</li>\n<li>「空条目」用来降低总掉率而不必改动其它条目；条件过滤必须在归一化之前完成，否则掉率会意外漂移。</li>\n<li>条件与上下文掉落支撑新手保护、去重、智能掉落等现代设计；JSON/YAML + 热更是主流的数据落地方式。</li>\n<li>本模型是<a href=\"../sampling/\">抽取</a>章所有算法的统一输入格式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../sampling/rarity-tiers\">稀有度层级</a> —— 嵌套表最典型的两阶段应用。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/loot-tables-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> —— 掉落数据的热更与工程实现。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../inventory-loot-itemization/foundations/item-instance-vs-template\">库存与物品化 · 实例与模板</a> —— 掉落条目里的「物品」在库存侧如何区分模板与实例。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../inventory-loot-itemization/loot-generation/loot-tables-drop-rates\">库存与物品化 · 掉落表与掉率</a> —— 从库存视角看掉落表的另一份处理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"掉落模型：掉落表的数据结构与嵌套组合","id":"掉落模型-掉落表的数据结构与嵌套组合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：掉落表的最小结构","id":"核心概念-掉落表的最小结构"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌套表：用组合对抗复杂度","id":"嵌套表-用组合对抗复杂度"},{"level":2,"text":"条件与上下文掉落","id":"条件与上下文掉落"},{"level":2,"text":"数据格式与热更","id":"数据格式与热更"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"随机与确定性奖励：可控随机的光谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/foundations/random-vs-deterministic"},"next":{"title":"加权随机：从权重到概率的抽样算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/weighted-random"}}